	)
	(text "PCM3060 in hardware-control mode, the same straps as Mutable Beads: MODE 220 kΩ to DGND =\nparallel control with differential outputs; FMT low = 24-bit I2S, IFMD low = ADC and DAC both\nslaves, DEMP low = no de-emphasis. One I2S bus feeds both halves. RST is pulled up, so the codec\nstarts by itself; CODEC_RST also reaches a hole (J303) so firmware can hold it in reset, as Beads\ndoes. Full scale is 20 Vpp in and out; firmware runs about 6 dB below. VCC via a ferrite from\n+5VA, VDD via 5.1 Ω from +3V3D: each with its own 10 µF + 100 nF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.5 1.5))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7b2fde1c-eb63-548a-ab90-661a502023bb")
	)
