	(text "AUDIO INPUTS: 22 Vpp → 3 Vpp (codec full scale). AC-coupled, inverting (firmware flips the sign).\n±12 V stays inside the codec rails, so the BAT54S clamps only act on faults. 100 nF on each + input\ndecouples VCOM (12.5 kΩ source) at the op-amp, as the Patch SM does."
