	(text "AUDIO OUTPUTS: balanced second-order MFB low-pass (Beads' topology), gain 30k/12k = 2.5, so 8 Vpp → 20 Vpp,\nDC-coupled, non-inverting (VOUT+ to the + side). 1 nF C0G across the two nodes and 100 pF from each op-amp input:\nf0 ≈ 65 kHz, Q ≈ 0.73, flat to 20 kHz (Basic parts except the 1 nF C0G). 1 kΩ 1206 out survives output-to-output patching."
